  "keyFeatures": [
    "Dependency injection via Markdown files — adding one file registers one new capability with zero skill changes",
    "Workflow state machine covering development, bugfix, testing, merge-conflict, and branch-op flows",
    "Git worktree isolation — each requirement gets its own worktree so multiple agents can develop in parallel",
    "Self-authoring commands via `record` — generates new commands automatically from a single command name",
    "Guidance closed-loop self-evolution — user corrections are auto-collected and crystallized into harness entries at close",
    "Defect origin tracing with `git-bug-trace` — pinpoints introducing commit, author, requirement ID, and MR link",
    "Code review and release gate commands with structured checklists",
    "Optional IDE Hook acceleration layer for TRAE and Claude Code",
    "Outward learning via `study` — distills ideas from external skills or repositories into the harness",
    "Cross-platform support (Linux, macOS, Windows via Git Bash / PowerShell launcher)"
  ],
